However, this is not the main difficulty of a conduct.  And I think 
"stupid loss of conduct" is annoying.  You should be able to concentrate 
on the game rather than on this single question.

In the case of levitation, it would mean that you have to identify all 
rings and boots and potions by other means than using them (after having 
determined their b/u/c status).  This I consider an unnecessary burden. 
  It does not contribute to the essential difficulty of the conduct, 
just makes it more annoying and more boring.  But I agree that this is 
an issue that may be considered from two sides.

